<title>AUSTRIA: Wienerberger suspended from Vienna bourse.</title>
<headline>Wienerberger suspended from Vienna bourse.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Wienerberger Baustoffindustrie, the world's largest brick maker, were suspended from trading on the Vienna bourse on Monday, the stock exchange said.</p>
<p>The shares were suspended pending an important announcement, the bourse said. Minutes after the suspension, Wienerberger announced it would sell its Treibacher abrasive materials unit to German industrialist family August von Finck. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
</text>
